Description: framework for developing visual-novel type games - web support
 Ren'Py is a programming language and runtime, intended to ease the creation
 of visual-novel type games. It contains features that make it easy to
 display thoughts, dialogue, and menus; to display images to the user; to
 write game logic; and to support the saving and loading of games.
 .
 This package installs the upstream Ren'Py 8.3.4 web (Renpyweb) files under
 /usr/share/games/renpy/web so the Debian Ren'Py launcher can build web
 distributions. It also installs a launcher helper so CLI web_build and
 distribute work without the full upstream SDK.

